  "bodyHash": "0c191a85271f6168",
  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong>Mekanism:MoreCapacity</strong></h1>\n<p>本模组允许部分 Mekanism 机器更改其气体储罐和液体储罐的容量。<br>可在配置文件中自由修改，默认值为原容量的 100 倍。<br>气体最大可扩展至 9223372036854775807mB，液体最大可扩展至 2147483647mB。</p>\n<p>本模组必须依赖&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a> 才能运行。</p>\n<h2>支持的附加模组</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism Extra</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-elements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism Elements</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/evolved-mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Evolved Mekanism</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-more-machine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism:More Machine</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d7870d3c-762e-4337-828f-30cb64127f18.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dc3884c3-7c66-404a-8a3d-4ac541430707.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism Extras</a> 和&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-science\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism Elements</a> 自 ver1.2 起获得支持</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/evolved-mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Evolved Mekanism</a>&nbsp;自 ver1.3 起获得支持</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-more-machine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism:More Machine</a>&nbsp;自 ver1.3.3-neoforge 起获得支持</p>",
